**Key Improvements:**
- Organization and Item have new properties for richer metadata (contact, legal, product info, units, etc.).
- General Class Axiom for :ValidInvoice defines an invoice fulfilling all mandatory constraints.
- More disjointness among technical classes.
- Individuals for common EDIFACT segment and element codes.
- All elements annotated with rdfs:label and rdfs:comment.

**Next:** I will validate this ontology for syntax and modeling pitfalls.

